    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001070020,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "それは……\r\nとても……うれしいです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200107/7012001070020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、よくやった\r\n一緒に頑張ってきたもんな！",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001070030,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200107/7012001070030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001070040,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世を、応援してくださる、\r\nファンのみなさまと……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200107/7012001070040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001070050,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさまの、おかげです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200107/7012001070050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何言っているんだ、凛世",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001070060,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200107/7012001070060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺たちが凛世を連れてきたんじゃない",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "凛世が、俺たちをここまで連れてきてくれたんだよ！",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001070070,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま方を、\r\n凛世が……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200107/7012001070070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001070080,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "そのようなこと、考えたことも、\r\nございませんでした……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200107/7012001070080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは。凛世らしいな",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001070090,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ならば、凛世は……\r\n優勝しなければ、なりません",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200107/7012001070090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001070100,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世を、応援してくださる、\r\nみなさまのためにも……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200107/7012001070100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、その意気だ！\r\n凛世ならきっと、優勝できる！",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最後まで、一緒に頑張ろうな！",
